msgid "Decryption key location. JWT tokens can be inner-signed and encrypted by OpenId Connect providers. However, it is not always possible to remotely introspect such tokens because the providers might not control the private decryption keys. In such cases set this property to point to the file containing the decryption private key in PEM or JSON Web Key (JWK) format. If this property is not set and the `private_key_jwt` client authentication method is used, the private key used to sign the client authentication JWT tokens are also used to decrypt the encrypted ID tokens."
msgstr "解密密钥位置。JWT 令牌可能由 OpenId Connect 提供商进行内部签名和加密。但是，由于提供商可能无法控制私有解密密钥，因此并非总能远程检查此类令牌。 在这种情况下，请将此属性设置为指向包含 PEM 或 JSON Web Key (JWK) 格式私有解密密钥的文件。如果未设置此属性且使用了 `private_key_jwt` 客户端身份验证方法，则用于对客户端身份验证 JWT 令牌进行签名的私有密钥也将用于解密加密的 ID 令牌。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_TOKEN_DECRYPTION_KEY_LOCATION+++[]"
msgstr "环境变量：env_var_with_copy_button:QUARKUS_OIDC_TOKEN_DECRYPTION_KEY_LOCATION[]"

