#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Both ID and access tokens are fetched from the OIDC provider as part of the authorization code flow. ID token is always verified on every user request as the primary token which is used to represent the principal and extract the roles. Access token is not verified by default since it is meant to be propagated to the downstream services. The verification of the access token should be enabled if it is injected as a JWT token. Access tokens obtained as part of the code flow are always verified if `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` property is set to `accesstoken` which means the authorization decision is based on the roles extracted from the access token. Bearer access tokens are always verified.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_AUTHENTICATION_VERIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus-oidc-authentication-verify-access-token[quarkus.oidc.authentication.verify-access-token]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Both ID and access tokens are fetched from the OIDC provider as part of the authorization code flow. ID token is always verified on every user request as the primary token which is used to represent the principal and extract the roles. Access token is not verified by default since it is meant to be propagated to the downstream services. The verification of the access token should be enabled if it is injected as a JWT token. Access tokens obtained as part of the code flow are always verified if `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` property is set to `accesstoken` which means the authorization decision is based on the roles extracted from the access token. Bearer access tokens are always verified."
msgstr "作为授权码流程的一部分，ID 令牌和访问令牌均从 OIDC 提供商处获取。ID 令牌作为代表主体并提取角色的主要令牌，会在每次用户请求时进行验证。访问令牌默认不进行验证，因为它旨在传递给下游服务。 如果访问令牌以 JWT 令牌的形式注入，则应启用对其的验证。如果 `quarkus.oidc.roles.source` 属性设置为 `accesstoken` ，则作为授权码流程一部分获取的访问令牌将始终被验证，这意味着授权决策将基于从访问令牌中提取的角色。Bearer 访问令牌将始终被验证。"

